<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="3."><l>God’s only goal in time</l><l>Is to pour out His Son,</l><l>His Spirit joined to mine,</l><l>Intrinsic’lly made one;</l><l>And fanned into a flame,</l><l>Would spread His fire, divine</l><l>Into my inward parts,</l><l>This four-part heart of mine.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
